etin in SH-SY5Y cells<sup>a</sup></p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th colspan="3" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Incubation</bold><hr/></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>RA isomer</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Inhibitor (1&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc>)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Growth inhibition (&#x00025; untreated cell growth)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">R116010</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">96.4&#x000b1;2.4</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">Acitretin</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">66.5&#x000b1;1.9</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0.01&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> ATRA</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02014;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">60.3&#x000b1;2.9</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">R116010</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">48.9&#x000b1;2.2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">Acitretin</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">52.2&#x000b1;2.3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0.1&#x02009;<italic>&#x003bc;</italic><sc>M</sc> 13cisRA</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02014;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">53.8&#x000b1;2.5</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">R116010</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">42&#x000b1;1.9</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">Acitretin</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="&#x000b1;" charoff="50">55.7&#x000b1;3.1</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote3"><label>a</label><p>Results are expressed as mean&#x000b1;s.e.m. from <italic>n</italic>&#x02a7e;3 experiments.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>